<title>USA: Borg-Warner unit wins Ill Power contract.</title>
<headline>Borg-Warner unit wins Ill Power contract.</headline>
<dateline>CHICAGO 1997-02-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Borg-Warner Protective Services Corp, a unit of Borg-Warner Security Corp, said Tuesday it won a five-year $18 million nuclear security contract from Illinois Power Co.</p>
<p>Armed and unarmed security officers will be provided at the utility's Clinton Power Station in Clinton, Ill.</p>
<p>Borg-Warner Security offers a range of services, including electronic and physical security under the Burns and Wells Fargo brand names.</p>
<p>	     ((Chicago newsdesk 312 408-8787))</p>
</text>
